{
    "title": "Dot Link - Connect the Dots",
    "description": "<b>Dot Link</b> is an addictive new dot-connect puzzle game! Match color dots to solve this brain puzzle with thousands of fun levels to play. This game challenges you to think out of the box and train your brain \u2013 it\u2019s perfect for anyone trying to keep their mind young!\r\n\r\n\u25b6\ufe0f<b>Dot Link is an easy-to-play dot connect game:</b> \u25b6\ufe0f\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f  Your mission? Connect matching color dots\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f  Match all the color dots on the board and don\u2019t let the pipes cross!\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f  Level up to enjoy new levels and keep your mind sharp \ud83d\udcaa \ud83e\udde0\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc8c<b>This game is for you if you like:</b>\ud83d\udc8c\r\n1\ufe0f\u20e3 Match Puzzle & Connect games\r\n2\ufe0f\u20e3 Beautiful minimalistic aesthetics with colorful dots and lines\r\n3\ufe0f\u20e3 Relaxing music and satisfying game pace\r\n\r\n\u2705 <b>Special features</b> \u2705\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f 5 difficulty levels: Beginner, Intermediate, Hard, Extreme, and Insane\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f Fun & relaxing music and sound effects\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f Easy-to-see board with Day and Night Mode and Color Blind setting\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f Never miss a beat with Undo and Restart features\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f Stuck? Connect every dot with the Hint feature!\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f Go the extra mile by completing the Daily Puzzle\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f More than 10,000 levels\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc9f <b>Highlights</b> \ud83d\udc9f\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f Play on any device (phone & tablet friendly)\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f Suitable for all ages\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f Multiple languages supported\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f Dot Link costs nothing to download and play!\r\n\r\nDownload now <b>Dot Link</b> free on Android, one of the best match color puzzle games of 2023! Do you have what it takes to solve all the puzzles and become a true dots-connect master? \ud83d\udc51",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Dot Link</b> is an addictive new dot-connect puzzle game! Match color dots to solve this brain puzzle with thousands of fun levels to play. This game challenges you to think out of the box and train your brain \u2013 it\u2019s perfect for anyone trying to keep their mind young!<br><br>\u25b6\ufe0f<b>Dot Link is an easy-to-play dot connect game:</b> \u25b6\ufe0f<br>\u25aa\ufe0f  Your mission? Connect matching color dots<br>\u25aa\ufe0f  Match all the color dots on the board and don\u2019t let the pipes cross!<br>\u25aa\ufe0f  Level up to enjoy new levels and keep your mind sharp \ud83d\udcaa \ud83e\udde0<br><br>\ud83d\udc8c<b>This game is for you if you like:</b>\ud83d\udc8c<br>1\ufe0f\u20e3 Match Puzzle &amp; Connect games<br>2\ufe0f\u20e3 Beautiful minimalistic aesthetics with colorful dots and lines<br>3\ufe0f\u20e3 Relaxing music and satisfying game pace<br><br>\u2705 <b>Special features</b> \u2705<br>\u25aa\ufe0f 5 difficulty levels: Beginner, Intermediate, Hard, Extreme, and Insane<br>\u25aa\ufe0f Fun &amp; relaxing music and sound effects<br>\u25aa\ufe0f Easy-to-see board with Day and Night Mode and Color Blind setting<br>\u25aa\ufe0f Never miss a beat with Undo and Restart features<br>\u25aa\ufe0f Stuck? Connect every dot with the Hint feature!<br>\u25aa\ufe0f Go the extra mile by completing the Daily Puzzle<br>\u25aa\ufe0f More than 10,000 levels<br><br>\ud83d\udc9f <b>Highlights</b> \ud83d\udc9f<br>\u25aa\ufe0f Play on any device (phone &amp; tablet friendly)<br>\u25aa\ufe0f Suitable for all ages<br>\u25aa\ufe0f Multiple languages supported<br>\u25aa\ufe0f Dot Link costs nothing to download and play!<br><br>Download now <b>Dot Link</b> free on Android, one of the best match color puzzle games of 2023! Do you have what it takes to solve all the puzzles and become a true dots-connect master? \ud83d\udc51",
